{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IKUlBW11VB1795734678.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德國軟件巨頭SAP據報計劃裁減最少1萬個職位，以向AI人工智能時代轉型。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，SAP今次重組最少影響百分之9的全球員工，由於相關討論仍在進行，最終裁員數目仍未有定案，並在勞資談判後，可能發生變化。</p><p></p><p>報道引述知情人士稱，所有部門都被要求，找出可能裁減的領域，當中產品及工程部門，以及銷售部尤其受到關注。作為今次調整的一部分，公司管理層將繼續重新設計產品開發及銷售模式。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.885264+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T00:17:15.983473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:37.230774+00:00","content_hash":"d9c61b6aebf6d4c63c166a045ed7179623577158dbf68ee5ef03387636fddb8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.885264+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}